  (8, 8, 7, 'Mercedes-Benz C-Class C 180 d Exclusive', 'Second owner Mercedes-Benz C-Class that has spent most of its life on longer motorway runs. Timing belt and water pump were replaced during the last major service. Viewings are possible on weekdays and by appointment on Saturdays.', 7590, 'ACTIVE', now() - interval '2029 hours', now() - interval '2029 hours'),
  (9, 9, 12, 'Škoda Fabia 1.0 TSI Ambition', 'One owner Škoda Fabia in very presentable condition inside and out. Timing belt and water pump were replaced during the last major service.', 13590, 'ACTIVE', now() - interval '2848 hours', now() - interval '2848 hours'),
